Subject: [PATCH] DSI desktop: no server round trips while drawing (text sizes
 computed locally), 8x12 pointer, quick buttons Desk/Test/Log/Bench on the
 touch screen, Bench and Save log in the Start menu, IPC ping-pong in dsbench

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
